<![CDATA[<font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Hi&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style=""><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span lang="EN-US">Hope you are doing well.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span lang="EN-US">I have just re-sent our welcome email to help you set up your
credentials and log into our portal. Please use the email address {!Contact.Email}&nbsp;and the new password you create.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span lang="EN-US">If you have any questions or if the issue persists, please let us know.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span lang="EN-US">Thank you, <o:p></o:p></span></p>

